WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:09.467
Tchati chikuyerekezera kuona patali, kuyezetsa ndi kabowo kakang'ono, ndi kuona pafupi.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:18.933
Tchati chikuwonetsa zotsatira za anthu osaona bwino patali ndi osaona bwino pafupi.

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:28.400
Zotsatira zina pa tchati zalembedwa kuti sizikutsimikizika.
